{
  "roleNotes": {
    "1": "dedicated phantom lancer and sven into the squishy clumped lines, juggernaut for the spin immunity and the ward sieges, clinkz for the skeleton walk tempo and the archer sieges, lifestealer into tanks, spectre for the global haunt cleanup, lone druid for the relentless bear sieges, nature's prophet for the global farm and the split pressure, tiny for the toss catches and the tower pressure, alchemist for the greed farm and the early stun follow ups, terrorblade for the metamorph sieges and the sunder saves, luna for the glaive wave clear and the eclipse clump kills, windranger for the shackle picks and the focus fire deletes, anti mage for the counter spell and the split push tempo",
    "2": "dedicated dragon knight into the magic mids, leshrac for the pulse nova teamfights and the edict sieges, slark for the pickoffs and the late snowball",
    "3": "dedicated enigma for the black hole teamfights and the eidolon pushes, dawnbreaker for the global ult presence and the tanky front, brewmaster for the primal split teamfights and the earth brewling sieges, necrophos as the sustain offlane that outlasts burst and deletes the tanky cores, doom for the ult that shuts any hero off and the devour lane lead, centaur for the stomp engages and the tanky front with the stampede saves, slardar for the corrosive haze strips and the amplified pick damage",
    "4": "dedicated rubick for the spell steals and the fade bolt trades, bounty hunter for the track economy, nyx assassin into the caster lines, mirana for the arrow picks and the moonlight engages, shadow shaman for the chain lockdown and the ward sieges from the roam, lion for the earth spike catches and the finger burst",
    "5": "dedicated winter wyvern for the curse turns and the cold embraces, lich for the frost shield sieges and the chain frost teamfights, clockwerk for the cogs isolations and the flare globals, witch doctor for the maledict bites and the death ward bounces"
  },
